•For advertising opportunities email: skysportspodcasts@sky.uk</description><link>https://www.skysports.com/podcasts</link><atom:link href="https://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com" rel="hub"/><itunes:subtitle><![CDATA[Sky Sports FPL Podcast is dedicated to helping you make the right choices each week in Fantasy Premier League]]></itunes:subtitle><itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit><itunes:type>episodic</itunes:type><itunes:category text="Sports"></itunes:category><itunes:category text="Sports"><itunes:category text="Fantasy Sports"/></itunes:category><itunes:category text="Sports"><itunes:category text="Soccer"/></itunes:category><itunes:new-feed-url>https://feeds.captivate.fm/sky-sports-fantasy/</itunes:new-feed-url><podcast:locked>no</podcast:locked><podcast:medium>podcast</podcast:medium><item><title>FPL is back! 2026/27 season preview: Rule changes, value-for-money picks &amp; Week 1 drafts</title><itunes:title>FPL is back! 2026/27 season preview: Rule changes, value-for-money picks &amp; Week 1 drafts</itunes:title><description><![CDATA[<p>James and Mark are back for another season of Fantasy Premier League on the Sky Sports FPL Podcast.</p><p>They're joined by Gianni Buttice to preview the upcoming season and pick out the players and teams we should either include or avoid as we finalise our squads.</p><p>Plus, they all also reveal their Week 1 drafts with just over a week to go until the season kicks off.</p><p>-</p><p>To join our Sky Sports mini league the code is 69F4T2</p><p>-</p><p>•You can watch the Premier League action live on Sky Sports. If you're not already a Sky customer, you can stream Sky Sports on your terms with a NOW membership. Sign up to NOW here: www.nowtv.com/membership/watch-sky-sports?DCMP=ilc_skysports_podcastlink</p><p></p><p>•Listen to every episode of the Sky Sports FPL Podcast here: www.skysports.com/football/news/11661/13193390/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast-fpl-tips-strategy-captaincy-and-transfers</p><p></p><p>•You can listen to the Sky Sports FPL Podcast on your smart speaker by asking it to "play Sky Sports FPL Podcast".</p><p></p><p>•For all the latest Premier League news, head to www.skysports.com/premier-league</p><p></p><p>•For advertising opportunities email: skysportspodcasts@sky.uk</p>]]></description><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>James and Mark are back for another season of Fantasy Premier League on the Sky Sports FPL Podcast.</p><p>They're joined by Gianni Buttice to preview the upcoming season and pick out the players and teams we should either include or avoid as we finalise our squads.</p><p>Plus, they all also reveal their Week 1 drafts with just over a week to go until the season kicks off.</p><p>-</p><p>To join our Sky Sports mini league the code is 69F4T2</p><p>-</p><p>•You can watch the Premier League action live on Sky Sports. If you're not already a Sky customer, you can stream Sky Sports on your terms with a NOW membership. Sign up to NOW here: www.nowtv.com/membership/watch-sky-sports?DCMP=ilc_skysports_podcastlink</p><p></p><p>•Listen to every episode of the Sky Sports FPL Podcast here: www.skysports.com/football/news/11661/13193390/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast-fpl-tips-strategy-captaincy-and-transfers</p><p></p><p>•You can listen to the Sky Sports FPL Podcast on your smart speaker by asking it to "play Sky Sports FPL Podcast".</p><p></p><p>•For all the latest Premier League news, head to www.skysports.com/premier-league</p><p></p><p>•For advertising opportunities email: skysportspodcasts@sky.uk</p>]]></content:encoded><link><![CDATA[https://www.skysports.com/podcasts]]></link><guid isPermaLink="false">e30baea2-5782-45e8-a6c8-1157e304e600</guid><itunes:image href="https://artwork.captivate.fm/99214497-6d14-421a-a8a7-c6995f10fb16/Sky-Sports-FPL-Podcast-Square.jpg"/><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 16:05:00 +0100</pubDate><enclosure url="https://episodes.captivate.fm/episode/e30baea2-5782-45e8-a6c8-1157e304e600.mp3?aw_0_1st.showid=98b0360e-5790-4a03-b362-6a79540416d8&amp;aw_0_1st.episodeid=e30baea2-5782-45e8-a6c8-1157e304e600" length="46693266" type="audio/mpeg"/><itunes:duration>48:38</itunes:duration><itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit><itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType></item><item><title>Season review | Fernandes POTY &amp; Salah FPL GOAT</title><itunes:title>Season review | Fernandes POTY &amp; Salah FPL GOAT</itunes:title><description><![CDATA[<p>Mark Briggs and James Savundra review the 2025/26 Premier League season with Sam and Lee Bonfield from FPL Family.</p><p>They debate who’s been the FPL player of the season and pay tribute to Mohamed Salah after his final game for Liverpool. They also crown the winner of the official Sky Sports News mini league.</p><p>-</p><p>•You can watch the Premier League action live on Sky Sports. If you're not already a Sky customer, you can stream Sky Sports on your terms with a NOW membership. Sign up to NOW here: www.nowtv.com/membership/watch-sky-sports?DCMP=ilc_skysports_podcastlink</p><p></p><p>•Listen to every episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast here: www.skysports.com/football/news/11661/13193390/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast-fpl-tips-strategy-captaincy-and-transfers</p><p></p><p>•You can listen to the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast on your smart speaker by asking it to "play Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast".</p><p></p><p>•For all the latest Premier League news, head to www.skysports.com/premier-league</p><p></p><p>•For advertising opportunities email: skysportspodcasts@sky.uk</p>]]></description><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Mark Briggs and James Savundra review the 2025/26 Premier League season with Sam and Lee Bonfield from FPL Family.</p><p>They debate who’s been the FPL player of the season and pay tribute to Mohamed Salah after his final game for Liverpool. They also crown the winner of the official Sky Sports News mini league.</p><p>-</p><p>•You can watch the Premier League action live on Sky Sports. If you're not already a Sky customer, you can stream Sky Sports on your terms with a NOW membership. Sign up to NOW here: www.nowtv.com/membership/watch-sky-sports?DCMP=ilc_skysports_podcastlink</p><p></p><p>•Listen to every episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast here: www.skysports.com/football/news/11661/13193390/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast-fpl-tips-strategy-captaincy-and-transfers</p><p></p><p>•You can listen to the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast on your smart speaker by asking it to "play Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast".</p><p></p><p>•For all the latest Premier League news, head to www.skysports.com/premier-league</p><p></p><p>•For advertising opportunities email: skysportspodcasts@sky.uk</p>]]></content:encoded><link><![CDATA[https://www.skysports.com/podcasts]]></link><guid isPermaLink="false">01a50e8e-1570-4370-97e2-706480d2d77b</guid><itunes:image href="https://artwork.captivate.fm/99214497-6d14-421a-a8a7-c6995f10fb16/Sky-Sports-FPL-Podcast-Square.jpg"/><pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 14:55:00 +0100</pubDate><enclosure url="https://episodes.captivate.fm/episode/01a50e8e-1570-4370-97e2-706480d2d77b.mp3?aw_0_1st.showid=98b0360e-5790-4a03-b362-6a79540416d8&amp;aw_0_1st.episodeid=01a50e8e-1570-4370-97e2-706480d2d77b" length="8213540" type="audio/mpeg"/><itunes:duration>08:33</itunes:duration><itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit><itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType></item><item><title>FPL Gameweek 38 | Best buys for final day</title><itunes:title>FPL Gameweek 38 | Best buys for final day</itunes:title><description><![CDATA[<p>James Savundra and Mark Briggs are joined by Gianni Buttice for this week’s episode.</p><p>After Manchester City could only draw with Bournemouth it means Arsenal are Premier League champions! With the title race now over, what does that mean for FPL?</p><p>Mark and Gianni also discuss some of the best one-week punts and ways you can gain on your mini-league rivals in Gameweek 38.</p><p>-</p><p>To join our Sky Sports mini league the code is 4Y5Z67</p><p>-</p><p>•You can watch the Premier League action live on Sky Sports. If you're not already a Sky customer, you can stream Sky Sports on your terms with a NOW membership. Sign up to NOW here: www.nowtv.com/membership/watch-sky-sports?DCMP=ilc_skysports_podcastlink</p><p></p><p>•Listen to every episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast here: www.skysports.com/football/news/11661/13193390/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast-fpl-tips-strategy-captaincy-and-transfers</p><p></p><p>•You can listen to the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast on your smart speaker by asking it to "play Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast".</p><p></p><p>•For all the latest Premier League news, head to www.skysports.com/premier-league</p><p></p><p>•For advertising opportunities email: skysportspodcasts@sky.uk</p>]]></description><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>James Savundra and Mark Briggs are joined by Gianni Buttice for this week’s episode.</p><p>After Manchester City could only draw with Bournemouth it means Arsenal are Premier League champions! With the title race now over, what does that mean for FPL?</p><p>Mark and Gianni also discuss some of the best one-week punts and ways you can gain on your mini-league rivals in Gameweek 38.</p><p>-</p><p>To join our Sky Sports mini league the code is 4Y5Z67</p><p>-</p><p>•You can watch the Premier League action live on Sky Sports. If you're not already a Sky customer, you can stream Sky Sports on your terms with a NOW membership. Sign up to NOW here: www.nowtv.com/membership/watch-sky-sports?DCMP=ilc_skysports_podcastlink</p><p></p><p>•Listen to every episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast here: www.skysports.com/football/news/11661/13193390/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast-fpl-tips-strategy-captaincy-and-transfers</p><p></p><p>•You can listen to the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast on your smart speaker by asking it to "play Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast".</p><p></p><p>•For all the latest Premier League news, head to www.skysports.com/premier-league</p><p></p><p>•For advertising opportunities email: skysportspodcasts@sky.uk</p>]]></content:encoded><link><![CDATA[https://www.skysports.com/podcasts]]></link><guid isPermaLink="false">3fbbc381-aa52-4c7b-ae17-7e22e022bc28</guid><itunes:image href="https://artwork.captivate.fm/99214497-6d14-421a-a8a7-c6995f10fb16/Sky-Sports-FPL-Podcast-Square.jpg"/><pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 17:10:00 +0100</pubDate><enclosure url="https://episodes.captivate.fm/episode/3fbbc381-aa52-4c7b-ae17-7e22e022bc28.mp3?aw_0_1st.showid=98b0360e-5790-4a03-b362-6a79540416d8&amp;aw_0_1st.episodeid=3fbbc381-aa52-4c7b-ae17-7e22e022bc28" length="35911250" type="audio/mpeg"/><itunes:duration>37:24</itunes:duration><itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit><itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType></item><item><title>FPL Gameweek 37 | Triple up on Arsenal players!</title><itunes:title>FPL Gameweek 37 | Triple up on Arsenal players!</itunes:title><description><![CDATA[<p>James Savundra and Mark Briggs are joined by Jack Ukiah for this week’s episode.</p><p></p><p>Double Gameweek 36 has gone very well for anyone that used their Triple Captain chip on Erling Haaland, but not so well for those that invested in the Crystal Palace defence. James, Mark and Jack reflect on what we’ve seen so far in the Double Gameweek.</p><p></p><p>They also look ahead to Gameweek 37 which is the penultimate week of the season. Mark tells you the best three Arsenal players to buy for their home game against Burnley.</p><p></p><p>To join our Sky Sports mini league the code is 4Y5Z67</p><p></p><p>•You can watch the Premier League action live on Sky Sports. If you're not already a Sky customer, you can stream Sky Sports on your terms with a NOW membership. Sign up to NOW here: www.nowtv.com/membership/watch-sky-sports?DCMP=ilc_skysports_podcastlink</p><p></p><p>•Listen to every episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast here: www.skysports.com/football/news/11661/13193390/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast-fpl-tips-strategy-captaincy-and-transfers</p><p></p><p>•You can listen to the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast on your smart speaker by asking it to "play Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast".</p><p></p><p>•For all the latest Premier League news, head to www.skysports.com/premier-league</p><p></p><p>•For advertising opportunities email: skysportspodcasts@sky.uk</p>]]></description><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>James Savundra and Mark Briggs are joined by Jack Ukiah for this week’s episode.</p><p></p><p>Double Gameweek 36 has gone very well for anyone that used their Triple Captain chip on Erling Haaland, but not so well for those that invested in the Crystal Palace defence. James, Mark and Jack reflect on what we’ve seen so far in the Double Gameweek.</p><p></p><p>They also look ahead to Gameweek 37 which is the penultimate week of the season. Mark tells you the best three Arsenal players to buy for their home game against Burnley.</p><p></p><p>To join our Sky Sports mini league the code is 4Y5Z67</p><p></p><p>•You can watch the Premier League action live on Sky Sports. If you're not already a Sky customer, you can stream Sky Sports on your terms with a NOW membership. Sign up to NOW here: www.nowtv.com/membership/watch-sky-sports?DCMP=ilc_skysports_podcastlink</p><p></p><p>•Listen to every episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast here: www.skysports.com/football/news/11661/13193390/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast-fpl-tips-strategy-captaincy-and-transfers</p><p></p><p>•You can listen to the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast on your smart speaker by asking it to "play Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast".</p><p></p><p>•For all the latest Premier League news, head to www.skysports.com/premier-league</p><p></p><p>•For advertising opportunities email: skysportspodcasts@sky.uk</p>]]></content:encoded><link><![CDATA[https://www.skysports.com/podcasts]]></link><guid isPermaLink="false">61acd182-f212-44f0-9e53-48dc9c48a3a5</guid><itunes:image href="https://artwork.captivate.fm/99214497-6d14-421a-a8a7-c6995f10fb16/Sky-Sports-FPL-Podcast-Square.jpg"/><pubDate>Tue, 12 May 2026 05:00:00 +0100</pubDate><enclosure url="https://episodes.captivate.fm/episode/61acd182-f212-44f0-9e53-48dc9c48a3a5.mp3?aw_0_1st.showid=98b0360e-5790-4a03-b362-6a79540416d8&amp;aw_0_1st.episodeid=61acd182-f212-44f0-9e53-48dc9c48a3a5" length="38491443" type="audio/mpeg"/><itunes:duration>40:05</itunes:duration><itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit><itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType></item><item><title>FPL Gameweek 36 | Sell Semenyo, buy Cherki?</title><itunes:title>FPL Gameweek 36 | Sell Semenyo, buy Cherki?</itunes:title><description><![CDATA[<p>Mark Briggs is joined by Holly Shand and Nick Grounds for this week’s episode.</p><p>It’s the last Double Gameweek of the season, so a great opportunity to use any remaining chips.</p><p>Crystal Palace and Manchester City both play twice but how many Palace players do you actually need? And is switching between different City players a good idea?</p><p>Arsenal are now firm favourites to win the Premier League title so is investing in their attack now more appealing than their defence?</p><p>To join our Sky Sports mini league the code is 4Y5Z67</p><p></p><p>•You can watch the Premier League action live on Sky Sports. If you're not already a Sky customer, you can stream Sky Sports on your terms with a NOW membership. Sign up to NOW here: www.nowtv.com/membership/watch-sky-sports?DCMP=ilc_skysports_podcastlink</p><p></p><p>•Listen to every episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast here: www.skysports.com/football/news/11661/13193390/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast-fpl-tips-strategy-captaincy-and-transfers</p><p></p><p>•You can listen to the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast on your smart speaker by asking it to "play Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast".</p><p></p><p>•For all the latest Premier League news, head to www.skysports.com/premier-league</p><p></p><p>•For advertising opportunities email: skysportspodcasts@sky.uk</p>]]></description><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Mark Briggs is joined by Holly Shand and Nick Grounds for this week’s episode.</p><p>It’s the last Double Gameweek of the season, so a great opportunity to use any remaining chips.</p><p>Crystal Palace and Manchester City both play twice but how many Palace players do you actually need? And is switching between different City players a good idea?</p><p>Arsenal are now firm favourites to win the Premier League title so is investing in their attack now more appealing than their defence?</p><p>To join our Sky Sports mini league the code is 4Y5Z67</p><p></p><p>•You can watch the Premier League action live on Sky Sports. If you're not already a Sky customer, you can stream Sky Sports on your terms with a NOW membership. Sign up to NOW here: www.nowtv.com/membership/watch-sky-sports?DCMP=ilc_skysports_podcastlink</p><p></p><p>•Listen to every episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast here: www.skysports.com/football/news/11661/13193390/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast-fpl-tips-strategy-captaincy-and-transfers</p><p></p><p>•You can listen to the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast on your smart speaker by asking it to "play Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast".</p><p></p><p>•For all the latest Premier League news, head to www.skysports.com/premier-league</p><p></p><p>•For advertising opportunities email: skysportspodcasts@sky.uk</p>]]></content:encoded><link><![CDATA[https://www.skysports.com/podcasts]]></link><guid isPermaLink="false">150c5f62-a017-4a71-adf3-33f07bb29a67</guid><itunes:image href="https://artwork.captivate.fm/99214497-6d14-421a-a8a7-c6995f10fb16/Sky-Sports-FPL-Podcast-Square.jpg"/><pubDate>Wed, 06 May 2026 17:15:00 +0100</pubDate><enclosure url="https://episodes.captivate.fm/episode/150c5f62-a017-4a71-adf3-33f07bb29a67.mp3?aw_0_1st.showid=98b0360e-5790-4a03-b362-6a79540416d8&amp;aw_0_1st.episodeid=150c5f62-a017-4a71-adf3-33f07bb29a67" length="31621435" type="audio/mpeg"/><itunes:duration>32:56</itunes:duration><itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit><itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType></item><item><title>FPL Gameweek 35 | Best players to pick on Wildcard</title><itunes:title>FPL Gameweek 35 | Best players to pick on Wildcard</itunes:title><description><![CDATA[<p>James Savundra and Mark Briggs are joined by FPL expert Pras Singhal for this week’s episode.</p><p>There’s just four weeks left in the season but still so much to play for! Gameweek 35 is looking like a great week to Wildcard for those that still have the chip available. James, Mark and Pras run through the best players to buy in each position.</p><p>They also discuss captaincy which is looking like a straight shootout between Bruno Fernandes and Erling Haaland.</p><p>-</p><p>To join our Sky Sports mini league the code is 4Y5Z67</p><p>-</p><p>•You can watch the Premier League action live on Sky Sports. If you're not already a Sky customer, you can stream Sky Sports on your terms with a NOW membership. Sign up to NOW here: www.nowtv.com/membership/watch-sky-sports?DCMP=ilc_skysports_podcastlink</p><p></p><p>•Listen to every episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast here: www.skysports.com/football/news/11661/13193390/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast-fpl-tips-strategy-captaincy-and-transfers</p><p></p><p>•You can listen to the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast on your smart speaker by asking it to "play Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast".</p><p></p><p>•For all the latest Premier League news, head to www.skysports.com/premier-league</p><p></p><p>•For advertising opportunities email: skysportspodcasts@sky.uk</p>]]></description><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>James Savundra and Mark Briggs are joined by FPL expert Pras Singhal for this week’s episode.</p><p>There’s just four weeks left in the season but still so much to play for! Gameweek 35 is looking like a great week to Wildcard for those that still have the chip available. James, Mark and Pras run through the best players to buy in each position.</p><p>They also discuss captaincy which is looking like a straight shootout between Bruno Fernandes and Erling Haaland.</p><p>-</p><p>To join our Sky Sports mini league the code is 4Y5Z67</p><p>-</p><p>•You can watch the Premier League action live