r this week’s episode.</p><p>They reflect on an eventful weekend of Premier League action and look ahead to Gameweek 26 which is the first Double Gameweek of the season!</p><p>Arsenal and Wolves both play twice so find out which players you should be targeting and if you should consider using your Triple Captain chip.</p>]]></content:encoded><link><![CDATA[https://www.skysports.com/podcasts]]></link><guid isPermaLink="false">34c068d5-5450-486a-be48-18da69c071e5</guid><itunes:image href="https://artwork.captivate.fm/99214497-6d14-421a-a8a7-c6995f10fb16/Sky-Sports-FPL-Podcast-Square.jpg"/><pubDate>Mon, 09 Feb 2026 15:05:00 +0100</pubDate><enclosure url="https://episodes.captivate.fm/episode/34c068d5-5450-486a-be48-18da69c071e5.mp3?aw_0_1st.showid=98b0360e-5790-4a03-b362-6a79540416d8&amp;aw_0_1st.episodeid=34c068d5-5450-486a-be48-18da69c071e5" length="32487269" type="audio/mpeg"/><itunes:duration>33:50</itunes:duration><itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit><itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType></item><item><title>FPL Gameweek 25 | Best Saka replacements</title><itunes:title>FPL Gameweek 25 | Best Saka replacements</itunes:title><description><![CDATA[<p>James Savundra and Mark Briggs are joined by Gianni Buttice for this week’s episode.</p><p>Bukayo Saka picked up an injury ahead of Arsenal’s game against Leeds. Mark tells you the best players to replace him with.</p><p>The first Double Gameweek of the season has been announced. Gianni has the details and tells you which players to target.</p><p>Captaincy is discussed too with Erling Haaland facing Liverpool away this weekend. Is Bruno Fernandes the standout alternative?</p>]]></description><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>James Savundra and Mark Briggs are joined by Gianni Buttice for this week’s episode.</p><p>Bukayo Saka picked up an injury ahead of Arsenal’s game against Leeds. Mark tells you the best players to replace him with.</p><p>The first Double Gameweek of the season has been announced. Gianni has the details and tells you which players to target.</p><p>Captaincy is discussed too with Erling Haaland facing Liverpool away this weekend. Is Bruno Fernandes the standout alternative?</p>]]></content:encoded><link><![CDATA[https://www.skysports.com/podcasts]]></link><guid isPermaLink="false">dbc5cba0-aeaf-4447-81ae-efafb4873160</guid><itunes:image href="https://artwork.captivate.fm/99214497-6d14-421a-a8a7-c6995f10fb16/Sky-Sports-FPL-Podcast-Square.jpg"/><pubDate>Tue, 03 Feb 2026 15:40:00 +0100</pubDate><enclosure url="https://episodes.captivate.fm/episode/dbc5cba0-aeaf-4447-81ae-efafb4873160.mp3?aw_0_1st.showid=98b0360e-5790-4a03-b362-6a79540416d8&amp;aw_0_1st.episodeid=dbc5cba0-aeaf-4447-81ae-efafb4873160" length="39543674" type="audio/mpeg"/><itunes:duration>41:11</itunes:duration><itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit><itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType></item><item><title>FPL Gameweek 24 | Time to Wildcard?</title><itunes:title>FPL Gameweek 24 | Time to Wildcard?</itunes:title><description><![CDATA[James Savundra and Mark Briggs are joined by Nick Grounds for this week’s episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast. <br /><br />Manchester United produced yet another impressive performance as they beat Premier League leaders Arsenal. But which United players should we be buying in FPL?<br /><br />Erling Haaland, Phil Foden and Hugo Ekitike were all benched last weekend so Mark and Nick explain what to do with them.<br /><br />They’ve also put together the best Wildcard draft for those who’ve activated the chip this week.<br /><br />Make sure to give Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast a follow so you don't miss an episode. To join our Sky Sports mini league the code is 4Y5Z67<br /><br />Listen to every episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast here: <a href="https://www.skysports.com/football/news/11661/13193390/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast-listen-and-subscribe-to-our-fantasy-premier-league-podcast" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">skysports.com/sky-sports-fanta