od week to Free Hit?</title><itunes:title>FPL Gameweek 13 | A good week to Free Hit?</itunes:title><description><![CDATA[James Savundra and Mark Briggs are joined by FPL expert Holly Shand for this week’s episode.<br /><br />After Arsenal thrashed Spurs 4-1 in the North London Derby, our experts discuss if Arsenal’s attackers are now becoming more valuable than their defenders.<br /><br />They also explain why Gameweek 13 could be a good opportunity to use the Free Hit chip. They run through a possible Free Hit draft as well.<br /><br />And for those that haven’t used their Triple Captain chip yet, they discuss if using it on Erling Haaland is a good idea this week.<br /><br />Make sure to give Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast a follow so you don't miss an episode. To join our Sky Sports mini league the code is 4Y5Z67<br /><br />Listen to every episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast here: <a href="https://www.skysports.com/football/news/11661/13193390/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast-listen-and-subscribe-to-our-fantasy-premier-league-podcast" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">skysports.com/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast</a><br /><br />You can listen to the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast on your smart speaker by saying "ask Global Player to play Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast".<br /><br />For all the latest Premier League news, head to <a href="https://www.skysports.com/premier-league" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">skysports.com/premier-league</a><br /><br />To get in touch with the podcast email: fantasy@sky.uk]]></description><content:encoded><![CDATA[James Savundra and Mark Briggs are joined by FPL expert Holly Shand for this week’s episode.<br /><br />After Arsenal thrashed Spurs 4-1 in the North London Derby, our experts discuss if Arsenal’s attackers are now becoming more valuable than their defenders.<br /><br />They also explain why Gameweek 13 could be a good opportunity to use the Free Hit chip. They run through a possible Free Hit draft as well.<br /><br />