e-455f-89a7-87fa3719a8a0.mp3?aw_0_1st.showid=98b0360e-5790-4a03-b362-6a79540416d8&amp;aw_0_1st.episodeid=1b825059-c06e-455f-89a7-87fa3719a8a0" length="44322619" type="audio/mpeg"/><itunes:duration>46:10</itunes:duration><itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit><itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType><itunes:summary>James Savundra and Mark Briggs are joined by Lee Bonfield from FPL Family for this week’s episode.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Erling Haaland scored twice last weekend to offer a timely reminder that going against him for captaincy is a big risk. He’s got a tough game against Liverpool this weekend though. So, do you play it safe or gamble by captaining someone else?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The panel talk about Declan Rice and whether he’s now Arsenal’s best attacking option. They also explain why this could be a good week to use the Bench Boost chip.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Make sure to give Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast a follow so you don&apos;t miss an episode. To join our Sky Sports mini league the code is 4Y5Z67&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Listen to every episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.skysports.com/football/news/11661/13193390/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast-listen-and-subscribe-to-our-fantasy-premier-league-podcast&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noreferrer noopener&quot;&gt;skysports.com/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You can listen to the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast on your smart speaker by saying &quot;ask Global Player to play Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast&quot;.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;For all the latest Premier League news, head to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.skysports.com/premier-league&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noreferrer noopener&quot;&gt;skysports.com/premier-league&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;To get in touch with the podcast email: fantasy@sky.uk</itunes:summary></item><item><title>FPL Gameweek 10 | Bring in Bryan Mbeumo!</title><itunes:title>FPL Gamew