em><item><title>FPL Gameweek 29 review | Sell Palmer, buy Fernandes?</title><itunes:title>FPL Gameweek 29 review | Sell Palmer, buy Fernandes?</itunes:title><description><![CDATA[James Savundra and Mark Briggs are joined by Jack Ukiah (@RedditorYT) for this week’s episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast.<br /><br />They reflect on Gameweek 29 where Bruno Fernandes was the top point scorer. They discuss whether the Manchester United captain is a good long-term option in FPL.<br /><br />James, Mark and Jack reveal their chip strategies and explain if now’s a good opportunity to activate your Wildcard.<br /><br />They also take an early look at the best captaincy options for Gameweek 30. Could Erling Haaland be a better choice than Mohamed Salah? Tune in to find out.<br /><br />Listen to every episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast here: <a href="https://www.skysports.com/football/news/11661/13193390/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast-listen-and-subscribe-to-our-fantasy-premier-league-podcast" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">skysports.com/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast</a><br /><br />You can listen to the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast on your smart speaker by saying "ask Global Player to play Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast".<br /><br />For all the latest Premier League news, head to <a href="https://www.skysports.com/premier-league" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">skysports.com/premier-league</a><br /><br />For advertising opportunities email: skysportspodcasts@sky.uk<br /><br />Make sure to give Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast a follow so you don't miss an episode. To join our Sky Sports mini league the code is 4Y5Z67<br /><br />Listen to every episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast here: <a href="https://www.skysports.com/football/news/11661/13193390/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast-listen-and-subscribe-to-our-fantasy-premier-league-podcast" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">skysports.com/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast</a><br /><br />You can listen to the Sky Sport