a and Mark Briggs are joined by FPL expert Gianni Buttice for this week’s episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast.<br /><br />Mohamed Salah has broken his own record for the most FPL points scored in a single season. He’s currently on 306 and Liverpool still have 9 games left to play. James, Mark and Gianni discuss if he could reach the 400-point mark.<br /><br />It was another disappointing week for Cole Palmer and some FPL managers are considering selling him and using the funds to buy Erling Haaland. Our experts give their take on that.<br /><br />They also look ahead to the upcoming round of fixtures which is the first ‘Blank Gameweek’ of the season. They explain if activating your Free Hit chip is the best strategy or if you’d be better off saving it for later in the season.<br /><br />Make sure to give Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast a follow so you don't miss an episode. To join our Sky Sports mini league the code is 4Y5Z67<br /><br />Listen to every episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast here: <a href="https://www.skysports.com/football/news/11661/13193390/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast-listen-and-subscribe-to-our-fantasy-premier-league-podcast" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">skysports.com/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast</a><br /><br />You can listen to the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast on your smart speaker by saying "ask Global Player to play Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast".<br /><br />For all the latest Premier League news, head to <a href="https://www.skysports.com/premier-league" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">skysports.com/premier-league</a><br /><br />To get in touch with the podcast email: fantasy@sky.uk]]></description><content:encoded><![CDATA[James Savundra and Mark Briggs are joined by FPL expert Gianni Buttice for this week’s episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast.<br /><br />Mohamed Salah has broken his own record for the most FPL points scored in a single season. He’s currently on 306 and Liverpool still have 9 games left to play. Jam