ansferred out players of the week despite facing Southampton up next. Josh makes a strong case about why you should keep him.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;James, Mark and Josh also weigh up the best captaincy options. Should you stick with the reliable Mohamed Salah or risk going for someone else? Tune in to find out.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Make sure to give Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast a follow so you don&apos;t miss an episode. To join our Sky Sports mini league the code is 4Y5Z67&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Listen to every episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.skysports.com/football/news/11661/13193390/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast-listen-and-subscribe-to-our-fantasy-premier-league-podcast&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noreferrer noopener&quot;&gt;skysports.com/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You can listen to the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast on your smart speaker by saying &quot;ask Global Player to play Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast&quot;.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;For all the latest Premier League news, head to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.skysports.com/premier-league&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noreferrer noopener&quot;&gt;skysports.com/premier-league&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;To get in touch with the podcast email: fantasy@sky.uk</itunes:summary></item><item><title>FPL Gameweek 26 | Make Glasner your assistant manager!</title><itunes:title>FPL Gameweek 26 | Make Glasner your assistant manager!</itunes:title><description><![CDATA[James Savundra and Mark Briggs are joined by Lee Bonfield from FPL Family.<br /><br />They reflect on Gameweek 25 which saw a few unlikely heroes emerge. They discuss if Arsenal’s Mikel Merino and Manchester City’s Omar Marmoush are worth considering.<br /><br />They look ahead to Gameweek 26 which is headlined by Manchester City versus Liverpool. Could it be a good week to captain someone other than Mohamed Salah? Tune in to find out.<br /><br />They also ru