. Do you go for Mohamed Salah or Alexander Isak? Tune in to find out the best option.<br /><br />Make sure to give Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast a follow so you don't miss an episode. To join our Sky Sports mini league the code is 4Y5Z67<br /><br />Listen to every episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast here: <a href="https://www.skysports.com/football/news/11661/13193390/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast-listen-and-subscribe-to-our-fantasy-premier-league-podcast" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">skysports.com/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast</a><br /><br />You can listen to the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast on your smart speaker by saying "ask Global Player to play Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast".<br /><br />For all the latest Premier League news, head to <a href="https://www.skysports.com/premier-league" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">skysports.com/premier-league</a><br /><br />To get in touch with the podcast email: fantasy@sky.uk]]></description><content:encoded><![CDATA[James Savundra and Mark Briggs are joined by FPL expert Gianni Buttice for this week’s episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast.<br /><br />Gameweek 22 threw up some surprising results including a 4-1 win for Bournemouth away to Newcastle. Should you bring in Justin Kluivert after his hat-trick in that game?<br /><br />James, Mark and Gianni also look ahead to the upcoming round of fixtures which is headlined by Manchester City versus Chelsea on the Saturday Night Football. Are Man City players like Erling Haaland and Phil Foden good options in FPL once again?<br /><br />The captaincy debate has split opinion this week. Do you go for Mohamed Salah or Alexander Isak? Tune in to find out the best option.<br /><br />Make sure to give Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast a follow so you don't miss an episode. To join our Sky Sports mini league the code is 4Y5Z67<br /><br />Listen to every episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast here: <a href="https://www.skysports.com/football/news/11661/13193390/sky-sports