 options. Is Mohamed Salah the best choice or is there a better option?<br /><br />Make sure to give Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast a follow so you don't miss an episode. To join our Sky Sports mini league the code is 4Y5Z67<br /><br />Listen to every episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast here: <a href="https://www.skysports.com/football/news/11661/13193390/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast-listen-and-subscribe-to-our-fantasy-premier-league-podcast" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">skysports.com/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast</a><br /><br />You can listen to the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast on your smart speaker by saying "ask Global Player to play Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast".<br /><br />For all the latest Premier League news, head to <a href="https://www.skysports.com/premier-league" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">skysports.com/premier-league</a><br /><br />To get in touch with the podcast email: fantasy@sky.uk]]></description><content:encoded><![CDATA[James Savundra and Mark Briggs are joined by FPL expert Gianni Buttice for this week’s episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast.<br /><br />James, Mark and Gianni discuss if it’s now time to replace Erling Haaland with a better performing player after he failed to score in Manchester City’s 4-0 defeat to Tottenham.<br /><br />They also look ahead to Gameweek 13 and why now could be a good time to buy Arsenal’s Bukayo Saka.<br /><br />Tune in as well to find out the top captaincy options. Is Mohamed Salah the best choice or is there a better option?<br /><br />Make sure to give Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast a follow so you don't miss an episode. To join our Sky Sports mini league the code is 4Y5Z67<br /><br />Listen to every episode of the Sky Sports Fantasy Podcast here: <a href="https://www.skysports.com/football/news/11661/13193390/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast-listen-and-subscribe-to-our-fantasy-premier-league-podcast" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">skysports.com/sky-sports-fantasy-podcast</a><br /><b